---
title: Milvus Embedding Schema Flow
---
flowchart LR
  U[Upload content/json] --> A[KnowledgeUploadAgent]
  A --> P[parseUploadInput\ncontent title tags meta]
  P --> T[writeUploadToSource\ntemp .md]
  T --> L[file_loader]
  L --> S[markdown_splitter]
  S --> I[milvus_indexer]
  I --> E[Doubao/Ark embedding]
  E --> V[[]float64 vectors]
  V --> C[docConverterFloatVector\n[]float32]
  C --> M[(Milvus collection)]
  M --> F1[id VarChar PK]
  M --> F2[vector FloatVector dim 2048]
  M --> F3[content VarChar]
  M --> F4[metadata JSON]
  M --> R[Milvus retriever\ncontent metadata output]
